<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=262" title="View the profile of Mendolok">Mendolok</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 46<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/matrix.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I was going to beat TIME . . . but I got High.<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=262"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1578.msg17926#msg17926"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1578.msg17926#msg17926">Re: Signing off ......</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #15 on:</b> September 21, 2005, 03:53:53 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"></div>Come on bro, you may call me a defector for leaving UoP, but I&#039;m sure if you were even remotely aware of my circumstances for leaving you would know it had nothing to do with selfish &quot;what&#039;s in it for me?&quot; reasons.  My biggest mistake was agreeing to be an officer in UoP because I became instantly aware of ALL the sh*t that was going on, the drama, etc.  I should have stayed a rank and file member, totally ignorant of any of the problems in the guild, and I&#039;d probably still be a member today.<br /><br />I&#039;m sure I had your REAL character&#039;s name figured out at one point in time, but its escaping me now.  I&#039;m thinking Sorcery . . . tight with the Boston officer crew (you spoke of running around with 4 or 5 officer), got really pissed at one point and blasted UoP on these boards, apped to RoS, went back to UoP . . . sounds about right, but I&#039;m not 100% sure.<br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"></div><br />Are you sure you didnt leave because of your pals Sippi and Xan and the pressures they were putting on the guild against the other clerics and the lack of support you were getting from senior officers to give you and your friends more input and power within the guild structure?&nbsp; And didnt you later leave the guild you left uop for to try and return?&nbsp; Not sure, but sounds like Merc Tactics and Whats in it For Me, more than, I became instantly aware of drama line, lol.<br /><br />This is didnt need to be about you or Kewee or whatever her name it (who wasnt even guilded with Soulfag for years while he was in UOP), but, you stuck your nose into this, so eat it up.<br /><br />PS - The Boston Crew, lol, nope, good guess, I did like Manntooth and his friends, never met them in RL, but in my years on the server, they were a ton better people who did more for their friends than Soulfag or Xerxes for that matter.&nbsp; Tut tut.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Mendolok<br />Chanter of Chanters<br />1000 faces for 1000 Camps
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg17927"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=855" title="View the profile of Raitnar">Raitnar</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 53<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/spectre.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/laretheq@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="laretheq@hotmail.com" border="0" /></a>
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=855"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:laretheq@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1578.msg17927#msg17927"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1578.msg17927#msg17927">Re: Signing off ......</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #16 on:</b> September 21, 2005, 07:04:47 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Wanna take this to rants and raves where it belongs? Flame all you want, just do it in the right section. No, I&#039;m not a mod, but I come to this board to read meaningful stuff that people may put. If I wanted to read rants and raves, I&#039;d go to that section.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Lord Raitnar Rahl, 68 Lord Protector of Rodcet Nife<br />Quellious server
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg17928"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=393" title="View the profile of Zerxes">Zerxes</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 114<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=393"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1578.msg17928#msg17928"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1578.msg17928#msg17928">Re: Signing off ......</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #17 on:</b> September 21, 2005, 07:57:53 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1578.msg17926#msg17926">Quote from: Mendolok on September 21, 2005, 03:53:53 pm</a></div><div class="quote">Are you sure you didnt leave because of your pals Sippi and Xan and the pressures they were putting on the guild against the other clerics and the lack of support you were getting from senior officers to give you and your friends more input and power within the guild structure?</div><br />Nope.&nbsp; Sorry, but I&#039;m afraid that is the wrong answer.&nbsp; It had to do with the fact that problems (yes, the cleric fighting being a BIG one) needed to be addressed and we had a MIA leader with no timetable on when/if he was coming back.&nbsp; Power vacuum ----&gt; no solutions -----&gt; drama.&nbsp; Also, I stepped down from being an officer and had made my decision that I was leaving before Sippi and others even mentioned leaving.&nbsp; Nice try junior, but get your facts straight next time.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"> And didnt you later leave the guild you left uop for to try and return?&nbsp; Not sure, but sounds like Merc Tactics and Whats in it For Me, more than, I became instantly aware of drama line, lol.<br /></div><br />BZZZZZZT! I&#039;m sorry anonymous poster, but that is once again the wrong answer.&nbsp; I left RoS when my work schedule was too hectic to raid with them, and there was no &quot;relief&quot; in sight, so deguilded and I left EQ.&nbsp; Never tried to return when my scheduled freed up because RoS had disbanded by that time.&nbsp; Again, nice try junior.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Wanna take this to rants and raves where it belongs? Flame all you want, just do it in the right section. No, I&#039;m not a mod, but I come to this board to read meaningful stuff that people may put. If I wanted to read rants and raves, I&#039;d go to that section.<br /></div><br />Dude, this board is effectively dead.&nbsp; This is probably the most activity its seen during the last month.&nbsp; If you want to read meaningful stuff, you&#039;re probably better off trying other EQ boards.<br /><br />P.S.&nbsp; Mendolok:&nbsp; Trust me when I tell you that you really, really, really do not want to me to come out and air all the dirty laundry I have about many of the old &quot;great UoP&quot; folks whom you undoubtedly view as your friends and great people.&nbsp; And I do say &quot;old&quot; UoP folks because UoP is a very different guild now than it was then.<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg17929"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=472" title="View the profile of Kriyn">Kriyn</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 95<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.treefingers.com/gallery/gallery/jonny/jonny54.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I&#039;m not living, I&#039;m just killing time<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
