								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							To Zerx - Was just a guess lol.&nbsp; But thanks for filling us in.&nbsp; No, no, no, please dont crush my dreams, dont let loose . . . the drama monster with your old skeletons in the closet issues, lol.<br /><br />Like I care.&nbsp; <br /><br /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wtf1.gif" alt="WTF" border="0" /><br /><br />This whole back and forth is now boring and kind of lame.&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/banghead2.gif" alt="banghead2" border="0" /><br /><br />This isnt about UOP, Zerxes, my old toons, or Kriyninyininyn (sp?&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm19.gif" alt="cwm19" border="0" /> ), its about . . .<br /><br /><br />SOULMATE IS GONE, YAY!&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" /><br /><br />You may now return to your dead, no one reads, &quot;informative&quot; board containing this weeks stunning revealing topic of, &quot;Im leaving EQ for good and wanted to say, good bye!&quot;&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm13.gif" alt="cwm13" border="0" /><br /><br />
						</td>
