	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg17931"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=262" title="View the profile of Mendolok">Mendolok</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 46<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/matrix.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I was going to beat TIME . . . but I got High.<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=262"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1578.msg17931#msg17931"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1578.msg17931#msg17931">Re: Signing off ......</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #20 on:</b> September 22, 2005, 04:57:16 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Something that is always fun but not as fun as bashing Soulmate, heres a neat mock (get it, mocking) application from Slayyer to UOP I pulled off their boards, those cool rebel ROS peeps like Zerx and Slayy who headed off to less drama and bigger pay days with ROS, ah, how I miss em, enjoy!&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /><br /><br /><br />Its not often we receive uber applications, but this one is definately cream of the crop and feel it needs to be shared with the family.<br /><br />Union of Power Application<br />--------------------------------------------------------------<br />Name: Slayyerr<br />E-mail Address: <a href="mailto:godofwar@toocool.com">godofwar@toocool.com</a> &lt;mailto:godofwar@toocool.com&gt;<br />Level: 70th(but play like I&#039;m 100th /flex)<br />Race: Dwarf<br />Class: Warrior<br />Epic Status: Have better.. I&#039;m Slayyerr, duh<br />AA Points: 2000+<br />Zone Keys: All, even the ones not in EQ yet cause I&#039;m so good.<br />Flags: Fully Time flagged, Also Fully flagged for zones not even in EQ yet like Grey Mountain, Battlefield Earth, Plane of More Time, Plane of More Justice etc.<br />Magelo: I&#039;d post my magelo, but all of your warriors would feel weak cause I&#039;m so good.<br />Referal: Pooj, Saltar, Flars.<br />Knows Referal: Some of my students in my art of war class that I teach..<br />Connection: Cable <br />My time zone is: Central USA<br />Date and Time I completed this application: 3/31/2005 5:21:21 PM PST<br />My IP Address: So.PoWer.keke.~<br />My Computer Host Name: So.Power.keke.~<br />What AA abilities do you have and what are you shooting for?: I have Everything... and then some.<br />How many secondaries do you have?: I don&#039;t play other chars, as far as I know there are only warriors.<br />Tell us a little bit about yourself. What kind of person are you? <br />I consider myself to be the best tank server-wide, ever. Anyone who has better gear than me are cheaters. <br />What do you find is the best part of EQ?: Whatever I do and when I do it, but mainly when &quot;I&quot; do it.<br /><br />Armor quest pieces that drop in Bastion of Thunder are completed in: I don&#039;t know, this gear is weak compaired to my l33t gear.<br />If you are already flagged for Plane of Earth, Plane of Water and Plane of Air what is the last flag needed to gain access to Plane of Fire?: I&#039;m too cool to answer this question. <br />What zone can Grand Librarian Maelin be found in?: I&#039;m too cool to answer this question as well.<br />If you want to disband from a raid, you do the following?: Tell the raid leader that I&#039;m leaving, which should end the raid even if there&#039;s 71 people left in the raid including 10 more &quot;so called&quot; warriors.<br /><br />If you type the command /assist off, what does it do?: Makes it so when you hit your assist key, you don&#039;t attack without hitting A or attack hotkey. Also, everyone should have an /assist slayyer hotkey only, even when I&#039;m not online and others are trying to tank.<br />Which flagging mob provides access to the Plane of Tactics (Drunder, Fortress of Zek)?: Too cool, sorry.<br /><br />Here&#039;s some information about my former guilds: UoP, RoS. I was removed from UoP cause I was too cool and uber. I feel UoP knows how powerful I am and needs to take me back after RoS fell to my might.<br /><br />I&#039;d like to join because: Well, it&#039;s not really that &quot;I&#039;d&quot; like to join, but as we all know when I left UoP I said you&#039;d collapse without me, and even though it&#039;s been a couple years or so and hasn&#039;t happened yet, I&#039;m sure it will soon and I can stop it from happening.<br /><br />What do you have to offer UoP?: Are you serious? I&#039;m slayyerr, best tank server-wide, devourer of guilds and small servers. It would be foolish to not take me.<br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
